%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1d964d57d8f2a8645b731e5591055186, type: 3}
  m_Name: AncientEldonArticyEchoCrystal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: I've been waiting for you.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Hideshi
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1d68cf1441823f4438d8af9c5ba43460, type: 3}
    text: We came, just as you asked.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: Last night, I dreamed of something useful.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: After that, I knew what we should try.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Hideshi
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1d68cf1441823f4438d8af9c5ba43460, type: 3}
    text: Try what, exactly?
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: Build a crystal.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Haru
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: A crystal?
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: It is not very complicated. But I don't have the materials.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Hideshi
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1d68cf1441823f4438d8af9c5ba43460, type: 3}
    text: So what do you suggest?
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: You will have to gather them. If you want to go home, there is no other way.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Hideshi
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1d68cf1441823f4438d8af9c5ba43460, type: 3}
    text: What do we need?
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: Some of the materials can be found in Leymar. The rest lie beyond the settlement.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Haru
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: Is it dangerous?
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: Quite. But without them, you will be trapped here.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Hideshi
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1d68cf1441823f4438d8af9c5ba43460, type: 3}
    text: Can anyone help us find the materials?
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: Garr Steelclad is a blacksmith. He knows what you need and where to find it.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: Give him this.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: When the crystal is ready, come back. Then I'll tell you what to do next.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Hideshi
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1d68cf1441823f4438d8af9c5ba43460, type: 3}
    text: All right, but we still don't understand what happened to us.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 1
    speakerName: Ancient Eldon
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: That is not what you need to focus on right now. You have something more important - the crystal!
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Hideshi
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1d68cf1441823f4438d8af9c5ba43460, type: 3}
    text: All right...
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Hideshi
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1d68cf1441823f4438d8af9c5ba43460, type: 3}
    text: Come on, Haru.
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Haru
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: Yeah...
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Haru
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: Why do they keep avoiding our questions?.. It's as if they can't see beyond their own little world...
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    actions: []
    choices: []
  - speakerSide: 0
    speakerName: Haru
    portraitOverride: {fileID: 0}
    text: Everyone here is so strange...
    nextLineIndex: -1
    endDialogueAfterLine: 1
    actions:
    - type: 4
      quest: {fileID: 0}
      storyFlag: eldon_echo_crystal_discussed
      silent: 1
    choices: []
